this is a scale template in lua:

@code lua

local chord_template = {
  name_long = "",
  name_short = "",
  type = "",
  notes = { } -- note steps are zero based.
}
@end

The interval numbers are relative steps - not absolute pitches.

Can you give me a table of as many musical scales possible with their respective names.
